# A release's files are published byte for byte, pinned by SHA-256 and
# signed: git must never change their line endings (core.autocrlf on
# Windows would otherwise turn CATALOG.TXT's bytes into others).
releases/** -text
*.ZIP binary
*.SIG binary
# The INFs are CRLF text files on FREEHOLD; keep them as committed too.
*.INF -text
CATALOG.TXT -text
CATALOG.SIG -text
